meta {
  name: Get All Report
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/report
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get All Report

  This request is used to get all report. This request interacts with the MySQL database, have a protected routes, and a pagination.

  ## Responses

  **200 — report fetched successfully.** Ordered in descending / ascending order by `report_title` or `created_at`
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "history fetched",
    "data": {
      "data": [
        {
          "id": "6f59235e-c398-8a83-2f95-3f1fbe95ca6e",
          "report_title": "Report A",
          "report_desc": "This is a report description",
          "report_category": "Shopping Cart",
          "is_reminder": 0,
          "reminder_at": {},
          "total_variety": 1,
          "total_item": 1,
          "report_items": "Nivea Extra White Repair & Protect",
          "item_price": 20000,
          "created_at": "2024-09-20 22:53:47"
        }
      ]
    },
    "report_header": [
      {
        "report_title": "Report A",
        "report_items": "Nivea Extra White Repair & Protect"
      }
    ]
  }
```

  **401 — protected route need to include sign in token as authorization bearer**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login"
  }
```

  **404 — report failed to fetched**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "report not found"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}